Project Name: CampOS (It is shortened for campus operating system but can also be pronounced as campos aka "campus")

Tech Stack: Frontend (ReactJs), Backend/Storage(IndexedDB)

Project Description: CampOS is a university management system created for students to better organize their academic and financial activities

Features
- Module Managment: Storing and managing modules and assesments
- What-If Calculator: Calculates how much percentage you need to get a certain grade
- Emergency Mode: generates a personalized action plan for overwhelmed students by identifying and prioritising their most urgent and academically significant responsibilities based on metrics like (due date vs current date, grade weight) 
- Budget Tracking: Tracking income, expenses, spending categories and remaining budgets throughout the semester
- Dashboard: overview of student's academic performance, upcoming responsibilities, class schedules and financial status
- Calendar:Automatically displays upcoming assignments, examinations, classes and important academic events.
- Timetable: Custom Timetable based on your modules

